👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Security Groups
Two department-based security groups were created:
HR Group
   │
   └── HR User

IT Group
   │
   └── IT User
The groups use Assigned membership.
Why use groups?
Groups provide a centralized way to organize users and will later allow access to be managed collectively rather than assigning permissions individually to every user.
This will become particularly useful in the future RBAC project.
